        step(215, "Handle the components outside the k-circle", "处理 k 圆之外的分量", "For |kx| > k, kz is imaginary. The outgoing solution decays with distance, so very fine spatial structure is rapidly lost away from the object.", "当 |kx| > k 时，kz 为虚数。满足向外传播条件的解随距离衰减，因此很细的空间结构离开物体后会迅速减弱。", "evanescent"),
        step(240, "Turn the diagonal operator into an FFT recipe", "把对角算子变成 FFT 算法", "FFT → multiply by the transfer function → inverse FFT. Sampling and padding now decide whether the numerical field faithfully represents the continuous one.", "FFT → 乘传播传递函数 → 逆 FFT。接下来，采样与补零决定离散计算能否忠实表示连续光场。", "sampling"),
