        step(24, "Map directions to positions in the far field", "在远场把方向映射成位置", "At sufficiently large distance, the angular distribution becomes a spatial pattern. The Fraunhofer condition makes the input’s quadratic phase negligible.", "距离足够远时，角分布转化为空间图样。夫琅禾费条件保证输入端的二次相位可以忽略。"),
