        step(168, "Transform twice, then edit the middle plane", "连续变换两次，并编辑中间平面", "A second lens produces an inverted image. A mask between the lenses changes chosen frequencies before they recombine, giving low-pass or high-pass filtering.", "第二片透镜产生倒像。两片透镜之间的掩模在频率重新叠加之前修改指定分量，实现低通或高通滤波。", "twice"),
