        step(284, "Carry the finite pupil into the next question", "把有限孔径带入下一个问题", "A real lens accepts only a finite range of directions. That missing portion of the spectrum leads directly to the blur and resolution limits in E03.", "真实透镜只能接收有限范围的方向。被截去的频谱直接引出 E03 的模糊与分辨率限制。"),
